## Phase 0 — repository control

Ask Claude Code:

```text
Inspect this repository without editing. Map the customer, merchant, driver, admin, payment, WhatsApp, Supabase, and AI domains. Identify current behavior, incomplete behavior, stale branding, security-sensitive code, migrations, tests, and deployment assumptions. Produce a prioritized implementation map.
```

Deliverables:

```text
architecture-map.md
state-machines.md
security-boundary.md
missing-capabilities.md
