# Final operating principle

> **Claude should accelerate Alo King’s thinking, coding, testing, and documentation—but deterministic backend rules and human approvals must control money, permissions, customer data, vendor orders, and production changes.**

The strongest setup is not “Claude builds everything alone.” It is:

```text
Claude.ai decides and documents
→ Claude Code plans and implements
→ specialist agents review
→ hooks block unsafe actions
→ CI tests every change
→ GitHub PR records the decision
→ you approve consequential changes
→ staging proves the workflow
→ production is released deliberately
```

